(window.StoryDialogue = window.StoryDialogue || {})["ch-16"] = {"441601101":[["","XC 119, March 8, a secret laboratory somewhere in East Milkhama."],["","More than twenty researchers gathered in the laboratory. All are experts in Bionic Intelligence Frame technology, brought in or trained by Lukmund himself."],["","These industry elites gathered in front of a huge display screen, looking worriedly at the densely packed charts and numbers."],["","\"Protocol Override completion rate from L module to Q module is 72%, consensus mechanism overall correction rate is 46%\"—the two numbers representing progress haven't changed for four hours."],["","Worse still, their employer is silently observing everything from behind."],["Lukmund","...Is this the processing bottleneck you mentioned?"],["","The research director trembled at the sound and quickly threw out the long-prepared explanation."],["Research Director","Y-yes, without the direct computational support of the Legacy, we've had to allocate one-third of the units for masking operations to counter the local surveillance system's sporadic intrusions."],["Research Director","Relying on the remaining processing power of the existing equipment, it will take more than... uh, two months to achieve your goal, Governor."],["","After explaining the situation, the Research Director nervously observed Lukmund's reaction."],["","As expected, he furrowed his brows, but his sharp gaze did not fall on anyone present."],["Lukmund","Ada Diaz, you really know how to cause me trouble..."],["Research Director","...Excuse me, sir?"],["","The Research Director couldn't quite catch Lukmund's whispered reproach, but Lukmund had no intention of responding further."],["Lukmund","Eight sets of new Bionic Intelligence Frame arrays will arrive at the laboratory this afternoon."],["Lukmund","In one week, I want to see a report showing overall progress exceeding 80%."],["","Before the Research Director can respond, Lukmund turns and walks out of the laboratory. After signaling the bodyguards to keep their distance with a glance, he dials into a highly encrypted communication channel."],["Lukmund","Ma'at, advance the operation to the second meeting in the afternoon. The specific timing will be determined by your judgment on-site."],["","On the comms screen, Ma'at showed a hint of surprise, but she still accepted the order."],["Ma'at","Understood. But Your Excellency, how should we handle tracking the Reversion Squad?"],["Lukmund","...Leave it to Victoria. Since this Ashford heiress is eager to make a name for herself, let's give her the opportunity."],["Lukmund","As long as she makes a move, those watching her will inevitably convey any shifts in the Central Mining Area and the Reversion Squad's unauthorized actions to the homeland."],["Lukmund","The attention of the Oceanic Conclave will inevitably be diverted, buying us some more time."],["","According to the original plan, he should have already completed the rewrite of the consensus mechanism with the help of the Legacy, thereby taking full control of the entire East Milkhama AI network and even launching a counter-infiltration against the local surveillance network."],["","And with Gabriel compromised, Felix slain, and Tiphys's fall, the DL forces he commanded should have been able to seize the chance to fully occupy the Central Mining Area and Sankara."],["","Those opportunists back in the homeland, enticed by huge profits, should have also assisted him in restraining the Oceanic Conclave and the Oversight Committee... But so far, none of this has come to fruition."],["","Due to repeated interference from the GKD, the situation in East Milkhama is gradually spiraling out of control, filling Lukmund with a faint but irrepressible sense of unease and irritation."],["Lukmund","This is our last chance to regain the initiative, Ma'at. Act quickly."],["","Meanwhile, near Belsuth, East Milkhama"],["","The GKD Squad has just shaken off the DL pursuers and slipped into a pre-arranged safe house, where two old friends are waiting for them."],["Hong","Looks like you've had your work cut out for you since we parted ways."],["Grant","No kidding! First it was the DLAF, then the Security Maintenance Force, and finally even Ada showed up. I thought I might end up at the Fardan Institute!"],["Dana","Although we didn't suffer too much damage in the end, the problem lies with the Legacy..."],["Kaidan","...Sylvie, you once had contact with Ada. Do you know what she plans to do next?"],["Sylvie","No, she never revealed her plans after obtaining the Legacy to us, nor did she leave us a reliable means of contact."],["Sylvie","It's just, I remember her saying that the technology from the DL alone is still not enough to save Rosa..."],["Shawnee","As it happens, on this matter I have something worth sharing."],["Hong","Huh? Shawnee?"],["Dana","Your communications should be under complete surveillance. Isn't it dangerous to contact us like this?"],["Shawnee","Due to the previous EMP attack, the listening devices Lukmund prepared were partially damaged. It means we get a few minutes of secure communication here and there."],["Shawnee","Time is limited, so I'll be brief—three hours ago, we detected Valkyrie's combat signal."],["Kaidan","What did you just say!?"],["Sylvie","Valkyrie... Rosa, in combat? Are you sure!?"],["Shawnee","Diracca's forces also detected similar signals, it should be correct. I've sent over the relevant data."],["","As Shawnee spoke, concise encrypted data appeared on Kaidan and the others' terminals."],["Shawnee","In fact, earlier on, there were signals of a large number of Obsidian STs in the same direction, which seemed to have engaged in battle with several unidentified DL STs."],["Shawnee","We suspect this is related to the subsequent Valkyrie combat signal."],["","Kaidan and the others listened to Shawnee's explanation while carefully examining the newly received data, trying not to overlook a single detail."],["","Fortunately, they did have an unexpected discovery—among those unidentified DL ST signals, there happened to be one they had encountered not long ago."],["Dana","Feature comparison complete—this signal is undoubtedly Paloma's!"],["Grant","That being said, the other signals are likely from the other members of the Reversion Squad... But why are they clashing with Obsidian?"],["Shawnee","More specific intel has been tightly sealed by the Oversight Committee. In my current position, accessing it is no easy task."],["Kaidan","Looks like we've got some detective work to do."],["","Without any hesitation, Kaidan made a decision. The others present nodded in agreement."],["Sylvie","If Rosa truly awakens and takes up her weapon again, it must be due to some major change we're yet to understand."],["Hong","Setting Ada and the Reversion Squad aside, Obsidian's involvement all but guarantees some covert agenda is in play."],["","Everyone agreed instantly—the next course of action was agreed implicitly."],["Kaidan","Shawnee, synchronize all related locations with us."]],"441601301":[["","With fire-control radar locked on and comms surveillance covering multiple channels, everyone stayed on high alert all the way, constantly watching for anything Camilla might have had up her sleeve."],["","Thus, with Camilla dragging Lucia's ST along under close surveillance, they headed to the safe house together."],["","As instructed by Kaidan, Epiphyllum kept the STs in full combat readiness in case of an emergency. At the same time, GKD accompanied Camilla out of her cockpit for direct negotiations."],["Kaidan","So, are you also after the data Lucia has about Rosa?"],["","Despite being constantly in Sylvie's sights, Camilla showed no sign of tension or dissatisfaction; she simply nodded calmly."],["Camilla","Eileen hopes to use it to investigate what kind of deal President Dean and Ada Diaz have made."],["Kaidan","What did you say? Ada is cooperating with the Predators?"],["","Click— a metallic sound rang out. An oversized sniper barrel, far too large for human hands, came to bear on Camilla."],["Sylvie","If your goal is to trip us up, you'd better consider your own safety."],["Camilla","I'm just speaking the truth... At least, my memory, diary, and communications with Eileen all record the same thing—"],["","While speaking, she took out a black encrypted data card and handed it over. Dana didn't read it immediately but connected it to a nearby device for rigorous security checks."],["Camilla","To seize Valkyrie, the Reversion Squad fought a brutal engagement against Obsidian's main attack force. In the end, Valkyrie somehow regained her power and forced the attackers to retreat."],["Camilla","After securing the Legacy, Ada Diaz arrived on the battlefield alongside the Predators and escorted the Valkyrie away."],["Camilla","Their goal? I have no idea. Perhaps... you know something?"],["","Kaidan gazes at the strange girl wrapped in bandages before him, unable to glean more information from her reactions, while the others are also lost in thought due to the ambiguous information."],["Hong","Could it be related to what Ada mentioned about \"saving Rosa\"?"],["Grant","Working with the Predators to save Rosa is like making a deal with the devil. Assuming Camilla isn't lying, then Ada must have been deceived!"],["Dana","But ultimately, it's just her side of the story. We can't guarantee that the records she provided are true."],["Kaidan","...Since it's hard to judge, let's see what the other person has to say."],["","Following Kaidan's gaze, everyone shifted their attention to Lucia, restrained in the chair beside them."],["","She had been enjoying the standoff from the sidelines, unnoticed and smug. But now all eyes were on her. Despite her efforts to seem composed, her darting eyes betrayed her anxiety."],["Lucia","Why are you looking at me? Continue your clown show."],["Kaidan","Tell me, what happened to Rosa, and where did Ada and the Predators take her?"],["Lucia","How would I know? I'm just a frontline squad leader tasked with data retrieval, I wouldn't know such secrets."],["Kaidan","Let me ask differently, after you retrieve data... where do you send it?"],["Lucia","You think I would tell—"],["","Before she could finish, Kaidan had already pulled out his pistol and pressed it against her forehead. Lucia swallowed her words, reflexively gulping and staring intently at Kaidan."],["Lucia","You, you wouldn't dare!"],["Kaidan","Really? I'm quite sure you're not someone who would gamble your life for company secrets, but on the other hand, are you really sure I won't pull the trigger?"],["Kaidan","Even without you, we still have a chance to gather intelligence with Camilla's assistance, it would just be a bit more troublesome..."],["","He disengaged the safety, his finger applying slight pressure on the trigger—"],["Lucia","...You win! You win, okay?! I'll talk! Just put the gun away—what if it goes off!?"],["Kaidan","Wise choice. Dana, give her a tactical tablet and have her transmit the coordinates and data over, then compare it with the records provided by Camilla."],["Sylvie","...Where'd you learn that kind of intimidation tactic?"],["","\"Of course, I learned it from you\"—but Kaidan wasn't nearly foolish enough to say that to her face."],["Kaidan","It's a required course for mercenaries, though I haven't practiced it in years. Fortunately, she gave up quickly enough."],["","Dana, standing nearby, quickly operates the tablet. She extracts the data she received from both sources, extracting a relatively authentic-looking battle video."],["","The video itself is not completely clear, but it's enough for everyone to recognize the black machine shadow that dominates the battlefield with overwhelming power."],["Grant","Although there's a bunch of things around that look like drones, this black ST really resembles the one Rosa used to pilot!"],["Sylvie","That movement and reaction, there's no mistake, it's Rosa! She's really awake..."],["","After the video ended, the tablet switched to the map of Milkhama Island, and the location Lucia mentioned was marked on the northernmost island of the entire map."],["Hong","Is this... Minet Island?"],["Dana","That's right, it's the small island where we pursued Rosa and encountered Ada after defeating Blair."],["Camilla","So that's where it is... There's a laboratory for the Rebirth project on Minet Island, perhaps that's their destination."],["Kaidan","It seems necessary to revisit the place. The remaining question is how to cross most of Milkhama Island in such a short time."],["Kaidan","The TINA is still waiting for repairs at Duke Port. It won't be coming over anytime soon."],["Eileen","Perhaps we can solve the problem you mentioned."],["Eileen","If you're all okay with it, that is. I take it no one gets airsick? Afraid of heights?"],["","Eileen's voice suddenly comes through Camilla's personal communicator, but Kaidan is not particularly surprised."],["Kaidan","So you've been watching from the shadows all along, Eileen Dizion."],["Eileen","Please don't misunderstand, this is just a protective measure for Camilla. Her contact with you is something of a surprise."],["Grant","You wanna talk surprises? You nearly got us killed when you teamed up with the UNCS Antibody Squad. Now that was one hell of a \"surprise\"!"],["Eileen","Regarding the Legacy, we have a position to assist the DL. Of course, I don't intend to make any excuses for having once been your enemy."],["Eileen","I just want to reiterate—right now, the Predators are our common enemy. Since all this is related to them, we have a reason to cooperate again... just like when we dealt with Blair."],["","As soon as the words were spoken, a loud noise came from outside the safe house and grew closer... it was the sound of jet engines and propellers."],["Sylvie","An Obsidian transport plane is approaching—should we open fire?"],["Kaidan","...No, let it land. The most important thing now is to catch up with Ada and the Predators."],["Kaidan","Bring Camilla and Lucia along. If Eileen plans to pull any tricks, they'll have to be used as hostages."],["","At the same time at the UNCS Sunset Valley Barracks, Hangar No.4... Cicero had just concluded his experiment."],["","He was confirming and re-confirming the data on the screen, unable to contain his excitement."],["Cicero","Amazing, simply amazing! The final missing piece of the Hyper-Aptamer technology and the Nova-Frame has today finally come together!"],["Cicero","Newman, Newman, Newman... It's amazing how you managed to hide such important information until now. Everyone was completely fooled by you!"],["Cicero","I bet you never imagined it would all fall into my hands! I will complete the true Hyper-Aptamer and Nova-Frame in your place, and then... surpass you!"],["","Within minutes of seeing the results, he had already conceived three different directions for improvement, each representing a new possibility that would revolutionize Hyper-Aptamer technology."],["","He was so lost in his own thoughts, he didn't notice that the previous experimental subject had already approached him from behind."],["Ophelia","How long do you plan to keep talking to yourself?"],["","Unlike Cicero, Ophelia's face showed little enthusiasm. Indeed, she looked rather annoyed."],["Ophelia","I've accompanied you through five rounds of meaningless experiments—you'd better give me results."],["Cicero","Hold on, Ophelia. You may not feel it clearly now, but I can assure you that your resonance synchronization with the Nova-Frame is very close to Valkyrie's level!"],["Ophelia","Close? Do you think that's what we're looking for?"],["Cicero","Uh... I mean, you can surpass her! It just requires a few adjustments. Both you, the pilot, and the Ouroboros running the Nova-Frame need to be overhauled."],["Cicero","Of course, you see, this is within our technological means! The problem lies in the fact that improving the framework requires high-spec simulated neural accessories, which can only be provided by the local Hyper-Aptamer Institute No. 11."],["","Although Winston has similar accessories at hand, Cicero would rather wait ten days or half a month than bow down to him for materials."],["","Ophelia is clearly not satisfied with this statement. She stares coldly at Cicero, about to say something—"],["","Is this the thing you're talking about?"],["","At that moment, a deep voice suddenly comes from behind the two, followed by the dull thud of a heavy object hitting the ground."],["","The two turned around, and at some point, a strangely dressed stranger had appeared in the previously empty space. Beside him was a large, sturdy-looking supply box."],["Cicero","Who's there? Could it be an intruder?! Guards, get this guy out of here—"],["Ophelia","Wait."],["","Ophelia reaches out to stop Cicero, then walks toward the man."],["Man in Cowboy Attire","It seems that after leaving Research Institute 9, you've been doing well, Σ-04—"],["","Before the words were finished, Ophelia had already drawn the blade from her waist at a speed beyond human reaction, placing it against the cowboy's neck."],["","But her expression did not relax in the slightest—because the revolver-style grenade launcher in the opponent's hand was aimed at Ophelia's head with equal speed."],["Ophelia","What are you doing here, Wyatt Morgan?"],["Wyatt","Completing my mission."],["","Wyatt casually tilted his head towards the supply box beside him, then looked at the Ouroboros being serviced in the distance, indifferent to the shallow blood mark the blade left on his neck."],["Ophelia","...Whose idea was that?"],["Wyatt","Huh? Isn't that obvious?"],["","Wyatt let out a helpless sigh."],["Wyatt","If it weren't for the military's orders, I would never have set foot on this godforsaken island again."],["","Cicero, who was observing all this, finally reacted. He used Ophelia's identity and authority to access the UNCS military's internal list and quickly found a matching result."],["Cicero","Colonel Wyatt Morgan... Are you from the NDF headquarters!?"],["","Wyatt was the first to put away his weapon. He then took off his hat and gave a slight bow. However, his casual manner made it hard to feel any sense of etiquette or sincerity."],["Wyatt","I know you have many questions, but there's no time to explain them one by one now."],["Wyatt","Let's get down to business before the guys at the GSA catch on."]],"441602101":[["","XC 119, March 8. Vesper Stronghold"],["Vesper Warrior","Anyone who can still move, lend a hand. This hangar could collapse at any moment—we need to move everything out, now!"],["","It's been some time since Goman launched the attack, but the Vesper stronghold is still in a state of chaos."],["Vesper Captain","Where's the doctor!? My brother's got a high fever! His wound, it's bleeding!"],["","The shortage of resources is secondary; the worst part is that there aren't enough personnel in the stronghold to handle the seemingly endless flow of new problems."],["","And it's not just the Vesper people who are witnessing this—"],["Squad 08 Member","I'm a military doctor, take me to your brother."],["Vesper Captain","Oh, you're with Squad 08... P-please follow me!"],["","Minutes later, the nearly-collapsed hangar on the other side suddenly roared. It vanished, swallowed beneath a cascade of earth and rubble, leaving the nearby onlookers staring at the rising dust with shaken nerves."],["Vesper Warrior","Good thing you guys helped, otherwise most of us would've still been in there."],["Squad 08 Captain","We should check the remaining rooms and reinforce any that have issues to prevent further problems."],["","Although neither side could completely let their guard down yet, the relationship between Squad 08 and Vesper had nonetheless begun to shift in subtle ways."],["Cassha","......"],["","Cassha quietly watched everything from the side. Her expression was quite complex, making it hard to tell whether she was more worried or more relieved."],["","Dragging the Mills and Squad 08 into this already went against Phoenix's wishes... and even if they truly became an asset to Vesper, it likely still wouldn't be enough to overturn their current disadvantage."],["Lorenzo","Cassha, the reconnaissance team is back. They have some important intel."],["","Lorenzo briefly scanned the area but did not spot Arthur."],["Lorenzo","Where's Arthur?"],["Cassha","She went to check on Elise."],["Lorenzo","Dr. Elise... she still hasn't left Apophis's cockpit?"],["Cassha","Hmm... She's not like us, raised in the fire of war; to come to terms with this horror, it's going to take time."],["","The two turned their gaze towards the distant central hangar, where they could vaguely see Apophis, its cockpit sealed shut, and a red-haired girl pacing back and forth nearby."],["","After losing Phoenix, Arthur had sunken into a deep depression... yet here she was now, offering solace to others."],["Lorenzo","...Arthur's become strong too, hasn't she?"],["Cassha","To comfort Elise, perhaps she had to."],["","The two silently looked in the direction of the hangar for a moment."],["Cassha","Let's go to the operations room and hear what intel the reconnaissance team has brought back."],["","Cassha turns and takes a few steps, then stops suddenly, remembering something."],["Cassha","Have Rear Admiral Tiphys join us as well."],["Cassha","Regardless of their final decision, we don't need to hold back on intel."],["","XC 119, March 8, high noon. Above the Foren River."],["","Obsidian's transport aircraft carried the GKD Squad towards Minai island, its flight path deliberately skirting the chaotic Central Mining Area to minimize danger."],["","Even with that detour, they approached their destination in a fraction of the time a sea route would've required; the only issue was putting up with the aircraft's trademark turbulence and noise."],["Obsidian Pilot","Arriving at Minet Island in approximately 10 minutes. Please prepare for landing."],["Grant","Arriving so soon? I was just starting to settle in!"],["Hong","Don't worry, Grant, after the mission we'll be flying back on this thing again—provided we don't get shot down."],["Grant","Hey, quit trying to freak me out! Ahem... Hey, Camilla, where are the parachutes on this plane? No reason, just wanna check..."],["","The usual banter between the two lightened the atmosphere in the cabin."],["","Kaidan was pulled back from his long contemplation and smiled as he patted Grant on the shoulder."],["Kaidan","If you're scared, just crawl back into your ST. Its parachutes are huge, more than enough to float you to safety..."],["","Dana couldn't help but chuckle softly, but quickly checked herself, restoring her cool demeanor. She looked around the cabin and sighed."],["Dana","To think they managed to ready parachute equipment for several units so quickly, and secure a transport aircraft capable of holding everything... Obsidian never ceases to impress."],["Sylvie","It's not surprising, Obsidian's ascent in Milkhama was grounded in military power from the start. Look at those Predator monsters—they've even surpassed the army."],["","As she speaks, Sylvie's eyes shifted to Camilla, sitting quietly nearby."],["","Camilla noticed the pointed look but gave no reaction. Whether she had missed the barb in Sylvie's words or simply did not care, nobody could tell."],["Eileen","Please do not compare us to the Predators."],["Eileen","President Gideon may recklessly abuse technology for personal gain, but we do not. In fact, most of our actions are to deal with the troubles he creates."],["Kaidan","Raphael Gideon... Why is he so obsessed with Rosa and Hyper-Aptamer technology? Is it just to create more war machines like Catherine?"],["Eileen","Unfortunately, I don't know the details either. Even within the Obsidian board, he is considered quite unconventional."],["Eileen","Perhaps even President Obelisk never truly understood him..."],["","Warning! Fire-control lock detected. Warning—"],["Grant","What's going on?! Urgh—?!"],["","Accompanied by the sudden blare of alarms, the aircraft tilts unexpectedly, nearly sending Grant sprawling."],["Obsidian Pilot","Something on Minet Island has locked onto us, most likely an anti-air missile launcher! Electronic jamming is up. I'm going to drop as low as I can and get us closer to land!"],["Obsidian Pilot","The hatch will open in 20 seconds, please board your STs immediately!"],["Hong","...Speak of the devil! Is this really happening?!"],["Kaidan","Damn it! Get back to the STs and prepare for a forced landing!"]],"441602301":[["","Following Sloth, the group soon arrived at a research facility hidden within the rainforest."],["","Clearly not expecting Sloth to suddenly appear with enemies, the stationed Predator Guards were unable to mount an effective defense and were completely defeated by Kaidan and his group."],["","Some enemy units attempting to continue resistance were quickly eliminated by Epiphyllum's subsequent offensive."],["Sloth","Ah... Just keep the captured Predators in the depot over there. There's a ventilation system; they'll live."],["","Under the incredulous gaze of the Predators, Sloth casually led Kaidan and the others to suppress the entire research institute."],["","Everyone proceeded to the inner laboratory and took control of the researchers present. Fortunately, they had only just begun the data deletion process."],["Dana","...Found them, these are the ones!"],["","The retrieved data clearly shows the physical condition of the experiment subject Rosa, as well as the complete experiment process."],["Kaidan","After the battle, Rosa fell into a coma again, but her bodily functions seem to be fine. What exactly is going on?"],["Grant","The Predator guy connected the Legacy as well. This doesn't seem like just any treatment."],["","To find the answer, they carefully examined the experiment report. But this just raised more questions."],["","The first to notice the anomaly was Epiphyllum, who had also undergone the Hyper-Aptamer experiment."],["Hong","Are they... trying to eliminate Rosa's Hyper-Aptamer?"],["Sylvie","During the experiment, Rosa woke up for three minutes, and at that time, the Nova-Frame's Sync Ratio was being held below 50%. Could there be a connection...?"],["Sloth","This is the captain's goal—she hopes to combine the Rebirth technology of the Predators with the Hyper-Aptamer technology of the Legacy to turn Rosa back into a normal person."],["","Sloth leaned casually against the window, but the expression on his face was extremely serious."],["Sloth","Rosa is a nice gal, but precisely because of this, the captain doesn't want her to step onto the battlefield again... That's why she's cooperating with the Predators."],["Kaidan","Why are you telling us this?"],["Sloth","This was Veronica's idea... She can't fully trust the Predators. To be honest, neither do I."],["Sloth","They were almost too eager to go along with the experiment, even preparing the necessary equipment and plans early on... It's hard not to suspect the true intentions of Raphael Gideon."],["Sloth","However, from our standpoint, we probably won't be able to uncover the truth before things become irreversible."],["","Sloth's words made Kaidan's brow furrow even more."],["","He doesn't seem to be lying, but if that's the case, it means the Predators have another plan in the works, and Rosa has become the Reversion Squad's weakness."],["Dana","However, judging by the experiment data, their attempt seems to have failed. Rosa only briefly woke up, and her sync ratio with the Nova-Frame quickly returned to over 95%."],["Sloth","Ah... According to Paloma, it seems to be due to some kind of imbalance with the arashi particles. I don't really get it."],["Sloth","To solve this problem, they set off for the Central Mining Area."],["","After speaking, he began to swing his body significantly, like a warm-up exercise before a workout."],["Sloth","Alright, I think that's just about all I needed to tell you..."],["","Sloth, leaning against the window, suddenly fell backward, and then the whole person flipped out of the window."],["Grant","What!?"],["","The situation was too sudden, and it took a few seconds for them to react before rushing to the window."],["","He landed on the nearest air conditioning unit, rolled onto the third-floor balcony, slid down the nearby drainpipe, and jumped onto the military jeep parked by the wall."],["Sloth","You can find several transport helicopters one kilometer north—"],["","After waving to everyone, he started the jeep and drove off into the rainforest."],["Grant","Wow, who knew he had such skills!?"],["Hong","I'll go after him!"],["Kaidan","Forget it, Hong, he's not our target. Chasing him further will only waste more time."],["Eileen","Kaidan is right—hurry to the Central Mining Area."],["","Eileen's communicator suddenly rang again, but unlike before, everyone could sense an unprecedented seriousness and concern in her words."],["Camilla","What's wrong, Eileen?"],["","With a beep, an aerial photo was sent to everyone's communication terminal."],["","It was a somewhat unfamiliar large building, one-third of which had collapsed and was engulfed in flames and thick smoke."],["Eileen","Just five minutes ago, the Sankara Convention Center was hit by a bomb attack."],["Eileen","The UNCS Viceroy, Rosemary, is currently missing."],["","Sankara Convention Center, Backup Meeting Room"],["Gabriel","What have you all done!?"],["","Seeing the thick smoke and flames rising not far outside the window, Gabriel clenches his fists, his body trembling slightly with uncontrollable anger and shock."],["Gabriel","I revealed Vesper's operations to you and helped stall the UNCS at the meeting... and you do this?!"],["Gabriel","Sending agents to incite the Milkhamans, assassinating UNCS representatives—is this your so-called \"new future,\" Ma'at Sharif!?"],["Ma'at","...This is very regrettable."],["","This statement completely enraged Gabriel. He reached for his waist to draw his pistol, but unfortunately, he was still a step too slow."],["","The DL agent guarding beside Ma'at was already aiming the weapon at Gabriel's head. His pistol was quickly taken off him."],["Ma'at","...Keep an eye on him, and don't let him leave here until you get my signal."],["","Ma'at turned and left the room expressionlessly, leaving several agents still pointing their guns at the unarmed Gabriel."],["DL Agent","Please sit back in your chair, Mr. Gabriel."],["","Though fury still churned inside him, Gabriel hadn't lost his senses; he knew full well that his burly frame wouldn't stand a chance against the fire of an automatic weapon."],["","He silently sat back in the chair, beginning to ponder every possible way to escape."],["","And so, time ticked away... The chaos outside showed no signs of abating, and his subordinates never came to check on the situation—this was likely orchestrated by Lukmund."],["","Is there truly no hope left?"],["","Realizing he was powerless, Gabriel suddenly felt lost—why did he make those decisions, and what did he gain from them?"],["","Perhaps, from the moment he betrayed Vesper, he had already doomed the future of the Milkhaman people himself...?"],["","*tunk, tunk, tunk*—Just then, a knock on the door suddenly interrupted Gabriel's fermenting negative thoughts."],["","The agents exchanged glances, and after a simple exchange of signals and gestures, two of them quietly moved to the door. One checked through the peephole, while the other prepared to shoot."],["DL Agent","...No one?"],["DL Agent","Not good—the window!"],["","Seeing no one outside the door, the agents immediately concluded it was a diversion and turned their guns towards the window."],["","At that moment, a black shadow flashed by, seemingly about to break through the window. The agents reacted swiftly, ready to pull the trigger."],["DL Agent","Wait, is that a drone? Don't open—"],["","Unfortunately, they were a split second too late. Several agents had already opened fire. The bullets easily pierced the drone."],["","In the next instant, it transformed into an intense white light and a deafening noise. The agents staring directly at the target were stripped of their vision, hearing, and even part of their consciousness before they could react."],["","Even Gabriel, who was far from the window and had his view mostly obstructed by furniture, felt a wave of dizziness as his vision turned completely white."],["","Gabriel—down."],["","Despite his impaired hearing, Gabriel recognizes the sound of the door opening and a somewhat familiar, steady female voice. Without hesitation, he immediately hides behind the desk."],["","Then, a few more muffled gunshots and the sound of heavy objects falling to the ground are heard, followed by silence."],["","As his vision and hearing begin to recover and the dizziness subsides, he cautiously peers out again, finally noticing the changes in the room—"],["","A DL agent had slumped to the floor, leaving only a lavishly dressed lady sitting on the reception sofa, carefully wiping the silenced pistol in her hand."],["Gabriel","...Viceroy Rosemary!?"],["Rosemary","Please forgive me for taking such drastic action, I hope it hasn't caused you too much harm."],["","Though the truth was plain to see, Gabriel still found it hard to believe."],["Gabriel","I'm not seriously hurt, but you... how were you able to pull that off?"],["Rosemary","I may be a politician, but I'm also an agent of the GSA."],["","The Madam maintained her elegant smile as always."],["Rosemary","Not only that, I have excellent subordinates... Thanks to their efforts, we are well prepared for the attack on the DL."],["Rosemary","Their attack on the venue did not cause any casualties, so you don't have to worry about that."],["Gabriel","Is that so...? Thank goodness... thank goodness..."],["","As if a huge weight had been lifted from him, Gabriel lost strength and collapsed into a chair."],["","After half a minute, he raised his head again to look at Rosemary, with a certain determination in his eyes."],["Gabriel","What do you want me—want Free Milkhama—to do?"],["Gabriel","Raise a flag against the DL? Or surrender the mining rights of the Central Mining Area?"],["","Gabriel doesn't believe Rosemary would rescue him without any reason, but he also doesn't intend to make the same mistake he did with the DL. Therefore, he must ascertain her intentions."],["","However, Rosemary simply shook her head."],["Rosemary","You misunderstand, Lord Gabriel. You don't need to oppose the DL, nor do you need to give up the Central Mining Area."],["Rosemary","Rather, we hope that the Milkhaman people alone will retain the primary rights to the Central Mining Area."],["Gabriel","W-what?"],["","This is in stark contrast to the attitudes of Blair, Arnold, and even successive West Milkhama governments—Gabriel is left confused."],["Rosemary","Despite decades of development, the appearance of Milkhama Island has changed significantly from its original state, but the core interest pursued by all parties remains the arashi ore—this unique resource itself."],["Rosemary","Whether it's military conflict or political strife, they are merely tools to fight for this core interest... It's just that some people are too deeply involved to distinguish the ends from the means."],["Rosemary","Now it's time to stop this twisted game and bring the relationship between the UNCS and the Milkhamans back on track."],["Gabriel","And that means...?"],["","Rosemary took a folded white paper from her coat pocket, unfolded it, placed it on the table, and handed it to Gabriel."],["","This is a draft of a contract, listing over a dozen agreements in extremely concise language."],["Rosemary","We recognize the Milkhamans' claim to ownership of the Central Mining Area and will assist Free Milkhama in the recovery and development of the mining area. Accordingly—"],["Rosemary","For all minerals extracted from the Central Mining Area, the UNCS will have the privilege of first priority in trading."],["Rosemary","What do you think, Commander Gabriel?"]],"441603101":[["","Neutral City Milthus, Obsidian Chairman's Office"],["","On both sides are several sets of bookshelves filled with precious books in various languages and fields. Apart from that, the rest of the office is marked by an austere minimalism."],["","In the deepest part of the room, there is a slightly old office desk, and the usually decisive Eileen is standing respectfully beside it, quietly waiting for the reaction of the man opposite the desk."],["","After about five minutes, Obelisk, the chairman of the Obsidian Group's board, put down the report in his hand. Eileen, as if seizing the moment, began to speak and add her comments."],["Eileen","This is the raw data sent back from the research base on Minet Island, which the Predators didn't have time to destroy due to the surprise raid by the GKD."],["Eileen","In addition to these tests and experiments related to Rosa Díaz, Camilla also discovered a surveillance video—"],["","Eileen operated the tablet a few times and projected the video onto the nearby screen."],["","It was a scene resembling a laboratory, with several people standing beside the unconscious Rosa, discussing something. Eileen zoomed in on the video, focusing on one of the individuals."],["Eileen","Professor Nehru—the developer of Rebirth technology who hasn't appeared for many years—directly participated in this experiment."],["","Obelisk's expression showed no change. Even Eileen, who had worked for him for years, found it difficult to fathom his thoughts at the moment."],["Eileen","According to the current intel, after the experiment, Nehru himself seems to have returned to Predator headquarters, leaving only an elite unit to act alongside the Reversion Squad."],["Obelisk","Hmph, he's still the same as before, never taking risks himself."],["","With a tone that seemed both mocking and lamenting, Obelisk clearly has a thorough understanding of this old acquaintance he hasn't seen in years."],["Eileen","I've already dispatched a reconnaissance team to track Nehru's whereabouts, perhaps we can—"],["Obelisk","That won't be necessary."],["","Obelisk swiftly shot down Eileen's suggestion."],["Obelisk","Nehru's whereabouts are merely bait deliberately left by Raphael. It's a distraction."],["Obelisk","The real answer is actually on this paper."],["Eileen","Are you referring to... the Central Mining Area?"],["Obelisk","Raphael probably realized there was a secret deep within the mining area, which is why he intentionally guided the Diaz sisters there."],["Obelisk","Considering Goman's movements, this might also be related to the Ovett Revolutionary Army..."],["","With that said, Obelisk took the cane and stood up. He walked over to the window, gazing at the bustling cityscape beyond."],["Obelisk","Has Kaidan Newman already set off?"],["Eileen","Yes, they seized the Predator's transport helicopter twenty minutes ago and will soon return to the main island."],["Obelisk","In that case—Eileen, put the Mobile Guard on standby near the Central Mining Area. Provide extra support if necessary."],["Obelisk","Let me think... Send the Blackout Squad."],["Eileen","The Blackout Squad? But if I recall correctly, they haven't completed their final tuning."],["","Upon hearing this, Eileen couldn't help but show a surprised expression. She had considered many possibilities, but she didn't expect Obelisk to choose to deploy this unpredictable unit at this time."],["Obelisk","If they can't even handle a task like this, perhaps they're not worth training after all."],["Eileen","Got it. I'll arrange it right away."],["Obelisk","Hmm... Also, after arranging the strike force, I need you to head to the DL homeland as soon as possible."],["","He turned around, his sharp gaze fixed on Eileen, but offered no further explanation."],["","Eileen knew this was a test, a test to see if she was caught in a blind spot, unable to see the situation clearly."],["Eileen","You'd like me to inform the Oceanic Conclave about the Legacy and the Predators to keep Governor Lukmund in check?"],["","Obelisk showed a satisfied smile, then walked towards the opposite bookshelf without giving Eileen another glance."],["Obelisk","If you understand, then go. Don't disappoint me."],["","3 PM: Foren River, Eastern Jungle"],["","Several STs sped through the dense woods, startling a large flock of birds—it was Kaidan and the others, fresh back from Minet Island."],["","To avoid becoming a target for anti-aircraft fire again, they had to land the helicopter at a location farther from the Central Mining Area and continue their approach by land."],["Kaidan","Sylvie, status?"],["","Getting closer to the Central Mining Area, but the exact whereabouts of the Reversion Squad remain unknown. For this reason, Epiphyllum went another route, searching for clues along the way."],["Sylvie","We found the beacon left by the Reversion Squad; they seem to have rendezvoused with the Predator support unit here."],["Sylvie","Unfortunately, the beacon itself has been destroyed, and the traces of movement are a complete mess... It's impossible to work out their exact course... We're currently searching for other leads."],["Dana","After all, being the aces of the DL, these anti-tracking skills are no surprise."],["Grant","So what do we do now? We can't just blindly charge into the Central Mining Area. Well, not unless I crack open a few cold ones first..."],["","Faced with Grant's question, no one could provide a clear answer."],["","Due to the attack on the Convention Center, Sankara is currently under a comms lockdown. For now, there's no way to contact Matilda or Tiphys."],["Kaidan","Let's just take it one step at a time and see how it goes."],["","As he finished speaking, a small mail icon popped up simultaneously in the ST comms windows of the three GKD members."],["Kaidan","Is this... a critical operation task from the Harpy Guild?"],["Grant","Ugh, like we have time for this! Let me just click \"reject,\" and.."],["Dana","Wait—check the details!"],["","A note of surprise burst into Dana's voice. She highlighted part of the email and shared it with the other two."],["Grant","\"Drive off the Predator scout team interfering with the mission, assist the Harpy envoy in recovering important materials, and escort them into the Central Mining Area\"... Is this for real!?"],["Dana","The email also includes detailed map data, clearly marking the mission location and time, which almost overlaps with our route."],["Dana","This is definitely not a coincidence, but... how did Harpy know our movements? And why did they choose to intervene at this time?"],["Kaidan","...These questions can probably only be answered by that \"Harpy envoy.\""],["","Although unaware of the Harpy Guild's intentions, Kaidan's long experience working with them tells him that this commission's arrangement is not without reason."],["Kaidan","Prepare for battle at any moment—let's go check out the situation."]],"441603301":[["","Shortly after the battle, the Harpy Guild's recovery team took the truck, and Kaidan's group reunited with Epiphyllum. They're now heading towards the Central Mining Area, Adele leading the way."],["","Despite Kaidan's several attempts to probe, Adele Martin never disclosed any intel about Harpy's inner workings. When it came to the Ovett Revolutionary Army, however, she was more than willing to share what she knew."],["Grant","The mercenaries who attacked the TINA at Duke Port were from the Ovett Revolutionary Army? They had a presence on the island even back then?!"],["Adele","In fact, they arrived on the island much earlier than you might think."],["Adele","As early as last month, representatives of the Ovett Revolutionaries had a somewhat unpleasant encounter with Obsidian... Am I right, Miss Camilla?"],["","With a deliberate tone, Adele switches the focus of the conversation Camilla."],["","Unpleasant encounter... How could she forget? Remembering the Ovettian called Alena, she suddenly felt on edge."],["Camilla","...How did you know?"],["Adele","Milkhama Island is the foundation of the Harpy Guild; we pay attention to anything that might affect the situation on the island."],["Adele","Although most of the time, we choose to observe, waiting for opportunities and outcomes to naturally arise."],["Sylvie","But not this time. You directly intervened in the trade between the Predators and Ovett... What made you change your policy?"],["Adele","Hmm... You should be quite clear about the answer to this question."],["","Adele's expression seems to have become slightly more serious."],["Adele","UNCS and DL, Obsidian and Predator, the Principality of Ovett and the Revolutionary Army, Vesper and Free Milkhama... and countless free mercenaries."],["Adele","The last time Milkhama fell into such chaos was 20 years ago, which ultimately led to a bloody war that changed the island forever."],["Adele","What we're seeing now is a similar crisis."],["Kaidan","...I thought that grey organizations like yours wouldn't mind seeing a bit of chaos on the island."],["Adele","You're not completely wrong, but everything has its limits. When the war starts, the rules of the game will lose all meaning; victory will be decided by the barrel of a gun."],["Adele","For a guild like ours, surviving in the cracks, this is not a good thing... That's why I'm reaching out to you like this."],["","Adele's words make some sense, but they're not enough to completely dispel all of the GKD's doubts."],["Dana","I understand your position. How do you plan to get us deep into the Central Mining Area?"],["Dana","Ahead is the DLAF's outer defense line. Charging through isn't going to work."],["Adele","In truth... I won't be able to get you through that line."],["Grant","What? What are you trying to pull?!"],["","Grant's eyes widened in disbelief. A flat refusal on such a pivotal point—he couldn't believe it."],["Adele","I won't... but there's a group of people who are familiar with every inch of the Central Mining Area, have fought the Ovett Revolutionary Army several times, and are even well-versed in the DLAF's defenses."],["Adele","To successfully enter the depths of the Central Mining Area, there are no better guides than them."],["Kaidan","You can't be saying—!?"],["Adele","Bingo! I'm taking you to meet Vesper."],["","Meanwhile, outside the Vesper stronghold."],["","Thanks to the joint efforts of the Vesper warriors and Squad 08, the situation inside the stronghold has significantly improved."],["","The dangerous buildings have mostly been repaired or closed off, the STs and weapons have undergone initial maintenance, and the condition of the injured has mostly stabilized."],["","Vesper, however, had no plans to pause even for a moment."],["Arthur","Is the second team all here...?"],["","Arthur and the others carefully placed each small box neatly into the previously dug pit."],["","The resting Squad 08 recognized that those boxes were the items they had helped rescue from the collapsed buildings earlier."],["Vesper Captain","...Those were left by our fallen comrades."],["","The female Vesper captain who had been looking for a doctor carried a quiet sorrow. She spoke half-addressing Squad 08, half murmuring to herself."],["Vesper Captain","Before stepping onto the battlefield, everyone in Vesper chooses a token and seals it in an iron box engraved with their name."],["Vesper Captain","In this way, even if they die on the battlefield and their body can't be retrieved, there's a substitute for their funeral."],["","The soldiers of Squad 08 silently stare. Although they were once adversaries, as soldiers, they feel the deep significance of this simple funeral rite."],["","After a few more minutes, the iron boxes were mostly in place, yet more than half of the pit remained unfilled—space reserved for those now resting in coffins or maintenance pods."],["Cassha","...It's about time."],["","Lorenzo nodded, gathered the warriors around him, and prepared to head towards the building where the bodies of their comrades were temporarily placed."],["","But just then, the recently repaired outpost alarm system emitted a shrill sound."],["Cassha","What's going on?"],["Vesper Warrior","It's Ovett—they seem to have found new reinforcements. They're launching attacks on all our perimeter posts!"],["Arthur","Damn, why does it have to be now!"],["Lorenzo","The outer sentry points won't hold for long. We need to provide support."],["","Cassha furrowed her brows, for her a rare expression of anxiety."],["Cassha","Our current manpower is insufficient to support all the attacked sentry points simultaneously..."],["Tiphys","Then let's count in Squad 08 as well."],["","A steady and powerful deep voice suddenly rings out from behind the crowd."],["Arthur","Rear Admiral Tiphys?"],["Tiphys","I will hold the three outposts in the north and east with Squad 08, the rest is up to you."],["","While Vesper's warriors look surprised, Squad 08 take it in their stride, standing up and heading straight towards the hangar."],["Cassha","...Much appreciated."],["Cassha","The funeral is temporarily suspended. The 9th will stay to guard the stronghold. Anyone who's still able, board an ST! We attack immediately!"],["","Understanding the situation left little time for hesitation, Cassha immediately agreed to Tiphys's proposal. She shared the battlefield intel with Squad 08 without reservation and arranged a rough battle plan."],["","Before long, Vesper and Squad 08 form several motley groups of STs. The improvised force, full of machines in various states of disrepair, quickly head off in different directions."],["","The remaining 9th Squad covered the unburied pit with a large piece of armor, then quickly returned to their posts to observe the situation around the base perimeter."],["","After a few minutes, a slender figure staggered out of the hangar."],["Elise","Almost done, just one last step..."],["","Elise continued to step towards the building in the near distance, the temporary resting place for fallen Vesper warriors."],["","Maybe she'd been in the cabin too long, maybe it was a lack of rest and food—or maybe the shock from before was yet to fade—but she felt unsteady, as if she might collapse at any moment."],["","Elise eventually arrived at the destination, where the security lock had been lifted in advance for the funeral, allowing her to easily open the door."],["","Under normal circumstances, her actions would have been stopped early on—but now, no one noticed what was happening here."],["Elise","Wait for me, Phoenix..."]],"441604101":[["","At the Central Mining Area's DL Battle Command, a debate is ongoing."],["Matilda","I hope you can give me a reasonable explanation, Miss Ma'at Sharif—"],["Matilda","Why is the Security Maintenance Force making this kind of large-scale movement into Sankara? Why is the Convention Center under complete lockdown...? What mission have you been given?"],["","Apart from a few soldiers who remained at their stations, several others at HQ began to move in, gradually encircling Ma'at and her bodyguards."],["","Although they have some doubts about Matilda, the island's parachuted-in commander, they clearly have a greater disdain for the Security Maintenance Force."],["Ma'at","With all due respect, Major Matilda, this has nothing to do with you."],["","Despite being in the heart of the Defense Force's headquarters, Ma'at did not back down at all and instead confronted Matilda head-on."],["Ma'at","As the newly appointed commander of the Defense Force, your task now is not to question the actions of the Security Maintenance Force, but to complete the offensive operation against Vesper."],["Matilda","It is precisely to ensure the operation is foolproof that we cannot allow any instability in the rear of the front line."],["Matilda","At the very least, your department should provide a reasonable explanation for the cause and outcome of the explosion at the first Convention Center, shouldn't it?"],["Ma'at","Regarding this matter, the report I submitted earlier should be detailed enough. Or perhaps, Major, do you have doubts about its contents?"],["","Just as the situation reached a stalemate, a figure suddenly briskly entered the room."],["DL Agent","Commander Ma'at! I have important intelligence!"],["","The agent approached Ma'at and whispered something in her ear."],["Ma'at","What!?"],["","Though the message was short, Ma'at looked shaken."],["Ma'at","Sorry, Major Matilda, our mission is urgent, so we'll take our leave."],["Ma'at","If you still have doubts, I will resubmit a report after the mission is completed."],["","After speaking, she didn't wait for a reply and hurriedly left the headquarters with her team."],["Tactical Intelligence Officer","Giving up already? I thought Lukmund's favorite would be tougher."],["","The defense officers present also jeered and booed, then returned to their work. Only Matilda looked seriously in the direction Ma'at Sharif was leaving."],["Matilda","...Hardaway, what do you think?"],["","Upon hearing Matilda's inquiry, Hardaway emerged from behind the slightly ajar door of the operations room."],["Hardaway","\"Our people have been taken out, Gabriel is now acting with the UNCS agent, and they've sent a unit into the Central Mining Area\"—that's what they were whispering just now."],["","Watching him fiddle with the small device in his hand, Matilda shook her head, exasperated."],["Matilda","...You'd better change this habit, or one day you'll find yourself in a military court!"],["","Despite her words, the curve of her lips revealed something else."],["Matilda","Still, you did a good job this time. Now we can deduce their next move."],["Hardaway","Do you need me to reach out to Lord Gabriel?"],["Matilda","...No, we can't be sure yet what role the GSA is playing in this."],["Matilda","If you're restless, why not find a way to resolve the Security Maintenance Force's communication control before the operation?"],["Matilda","Although those things won't affect the internal communications of the Defense Forces, they will hinder our contact with the GKD."],["Hardaway","GKD Parcel Service... According to the last communication received, their target also seems to be the Central Mining Area."],["Matilda","That's the problem."],["","Matilda pointed to the clock in the corner of the screen, which was showing the countdown to the start of the offensive against Vesper."],["Matilda","Once the full-scale attack begins, the situation in the Central Mining Area will become unpredictable."],["Matilda","Even if we cannot intervene directly, we must try to avoid large-scale clashes between them and the Defense Forces."],["Hardaway","...And I must remind you, this business is even more likely to land you in a military court than eavesdropping on the Security Maintenance Force."],["Matilda","Haha, maybe. But being court martialed is better than letting the whole DLAF get dragged into some senseless war for politicians' personal agendas."],["Matilda","Since GKD Parcel Service still has the capacity to trace the whereabouts of the Legacy, we might as well take a gamble."],["","A severely damaged old depot in the eastern area of the Central Mining Area."],["","This depot was abandoned long ago and has been repeatedly hit during recent battles, making it a place deemed useless by all parties."],["","And it's precisely this that makes it a gathering place for those who wish to cover their tracks."],["Vesper Warrior","So, are we all here?"],["Sankara Resident","Yep, all the guys who want to join Vesper, we're right here."],["Vesper Warrior","Alright, let's head out then!"],["","Just then, there was a rhythmic knocking on the damaged door of the depot."],["","The Vesper warrior frowned. That wasn't just noise—it was a rendezvous signal."],["Vesper Warrior","Didn't you say everyone was here?"],["Sankara Resident","Ugh, I... dunno..."],["","The lead Vesper warrior tensed up. As the signal sounded again, he suddenly opened the door a crack and pointed his gun at the newcomer."],["Adele","Don't worry—it's me."],["Vesper Warrior","...Miss Adele Martin? What are you doing here?"],["","To the relief of the Vesper warrior, the visitor was not hostile. But this just brought more questions."],["Vesper Warrior","Today's not the day for collecting supplies."],["Adele","Hmm... Indeed. I'm not here to deliver supplies today—"],["Adele","In fact, I rescued some refugees hoping to join Vesper while on a mission, and I brought them along."],["","Adele slightly moved aside, allowing the Vesper warrior to see the figures standing behind her."],["Silent Man","......"],["Silent Woman","..."],["","Due to their clothing and the lighting, their specific appearances were unclear, but it could be roughly discerned that there were two men and four women."],["Vesper Warrior","This..."],["Adele","What's wrong? If you're worried about the number of people, don't be. The transport vehicles from the guild will handle their transportation; you just need to help guide the way."],["Adele","Or are you saying you don't trust me?"],["Vesper Warrior","No, no, no, of course we trust you! If it weren't for all the supplies and intel you've provided, Vesper might not have survived..."],["Vesper Warrior","...Since the Harpy Guild is willing to vouch for these people, I have no objection."],["Vesper Warrior","Please wait a moment, I'll go explain the situation to the other comrades."],["","After the Vesper warrior left, the figures behind Adele stepped forward—the GKD Parcel Service, operating under disguise."],["Kaidan","It seems Harpy has been supporting Vesper for a while now... At this point, nothing surprises me."],["Adele","Indeed, we've been collaborating with Vesper for some time... Though I must clarify—they approached us first."],["Adele","The masked Vesper leader met with our boss, though I don't know the details of their agreement."],["","At that moment, they heard the sound of a vehicle starting, and the Vesper warrior waved to them from afar."],["Vesper Warrior","Miss Martin, we can set off now!"],["","Adele also waved back to the other party, then turned to look at Kaidan and his group."],["Adele","Our next stop will be the Vesper stronghold... You'd better be ready."]],"441604301":[["Lorenzo","We placed landmines ahead. Keep close to me and stay on my path."],["","Lorenzo's ST leads the charge, advancing at high speed while simultaneously sending minefield data in real-time with those following behind."],["","Relying on the data provided by Hardaway, they have successfully avoided the encircling the DLAF's main force. Now, they need to rendezvous with the units of Cassha, Arthur, and others, and then return to the base together."],["","There, they'll sort out the fragmented, tangled information that's been piling up—a task crucial to everyone in this ragtag team."],["Adele","Hmm... Looking at it this way, our crew's really something."],["Adele","GKD, Epiphyllum, Obsidian, Vesper, DLAF... It'd be hard to find another unit with such a complex composition anywhere on Milkhama."],["","Perhaps noticing the considerable rift between Vesper and the GKD, Adele intentionally brought up the topic."],["Adele","For our Harpy Guild, such teamwork is a pleasant surprise."],["Lorenzo","Stop pretending, Adele Martin. The appearance of GKD Parcel Service and Obsidian here is all orchestrated by Harpy, isn't it?"],["Adele","Still as cold as ever, Moby Dick. Considering we once worked together, would it kill you to be a bit more friendly?"],["Adele","If you ever change your mind and return to Harpy, I could help you regain your status as a senior mercenary..."],["Lorenzo","Like that would ever happen."],["Grant","Do you two know each other?"],["Adele","He was once a freelance merc contracted with Harpy, just like you GKD guys... and now, he continues as our ally under the identity of Vesper."],["Lorenzo","Hmph, Vesper was never your \"ally.\""],["Lorenzo","GKD, you'd better not trust this woman too much either. Betting on multiple sides is a common tactic of Harpy, and as long as there's profit to be made, they can become enemies at any time."],["Kaidan","...We'll remember."],["Arthur","Lorenzo, can you hear me!?"],["Lorenzo","Arthur? We're approaching the designated rendezvous point, almost there—"],["Arthur","The rendezvous is off—return to the base quickly!"],["Arthur","A powerful DLAF force suddenly attacked the base, and the defenses of Squad 9 were easily breached. Now only you can make it in time!"],["Lorenzo","What did you just say!?"],["Dana","The main force of the DLAF couldn't have penetrated deep into the Central Mining Area so quickly... Could it be?"],["Kaidan","It must be... It's the Reversion Squad!"],["","At the Vesper stronghold, the battle is nearing its end—and only five minutes after the first shot was fired."],["Vesper Captain","Monsters... These guys are simply monsters...!"],["","Only a moment earlier, she had seen her entire 9th Armored Squad destroyed with ease by just one single ST."],["","Meanwhile, the remaining automated defense gunports were precisely and swiftly destroyed by several other STs."],["Ada","Leopold, Paloma—report."],["","Ada, who easily destroyed all enemy units, did not immediately penetrate the base but instead stopped at a distance, waiting for the battle to completely end."],["","Her gaze lingered on the black ST behind her... Despite having undergone some initial repairs, it still bore the marks of fierce battle."],["","XR-03-E Erinys—Ada came here to reawaken the person sleeping in its pilot cabin."],["Paloma","Don't worry, Captain, all the autonomous turrets have been taken care of~"],["Leopold","The remaining Vesper Puppets have all been disabled. Ready to proceed at any time."],["Ada","Good work, I wonder how the other two are doing."],["","Before these words land, the side gate of the stronghold is suddenly breached, and a heavily armored ST appears before the Reversion Squad."],["","It didn't pause for a moment, heading straight towards Ada."],["Yevgeny","As expected of the DL's ace squad, just three members managed to complete the frontal suppression of the stronghold."],["Yevgeny","I originally planned to clear the Vesper mobile sentry and then join with you for a frontal push. It seems that won't be necessary."],["","Accompanying Goman was a team of Ovett STs marching in unison. Although their numbers weren't large, Ada could sense they were well-trained, comparable to the special forces of the DLAF."],["Ada","No, if it weren't for the detection data you provided, Major, we wouldn't have been able to locate the target position so quickly."],["Ada","I just didn't expect it to be deep within Vesper's underground base."],["Yevgeny","The Milkhamans initially chose to build secret fortifications here, perhaps to hide the secret of the arashi mine... But after decades, it fell into the hands of Vesper."],["","After speaking, Goman's ST's main monitor swiftly scanned the battlefield, capturing the now unimpeded entrance to the base."],["Yevgeny","We should move, Captain Ada. If the intel is correct, GKD Parcel Service is approaching here."],["Paloma","Don't rush, Goman, the Predator's collaborator hasn't arrived yet!"],["Ada","No, it seems that she made it in time too."],["","Tap—tap—"],["","The sound of high heels tapping on the steel plate drew everyone's attention."],["","A lavishly dressed girl, her eyes covered by a peculiar visor, walks with graceful and elegant steps across the wreckage of a shattered cover."],["","On this blazing battlefield, the girl is not piloting a mech, nor is she wearing any armor... The scene was downright bizarre."],["Vesper Warrior","...Die, devil!"],["","An injured Vesper warrior, before falling unconscious, used his last strength to pull the trigger, sending a spray of bullets flying towards the girl."],["","However, only the crisp sound of metallic impacts was heard—the drones following Libby swiftly reached out to block all the bullets, preventing her from taking any damage."],["Libby","Dim red... The color of anger, fear, resistance... It's the last radiance before life fades away. It's only small, yet it can also be considered beautiful."],["Yevgeny","The Predators just had to send this one, didn't they..."],["","Goman made his distrust and displeasure plain, but he wasn't about to refuse cooperation because of it."],["","Reversion Squad, Obsidian, and Ovett—the three parties have gathered here solely to bring Rosa to the depths of the Central Mining Area to achieve their respective goals."],["Yevgeny","The detection device has locked onto the area with the highest concentration of arashi particles. I'll lead the way."],["Libby","No need to trouble the major, I've already seen it—within the massive cavity left by the impact, secrets woven over countless years are inviting us."],["Libby","Shifting whites, iridescent reds, flickering yellows... Ah, this overlapping and intertwining of all wavelengths of light, what a kaleidoscope of colors!"],["","Libby slowly approaches the Vesper stronghold, and with each step closer, her tone seems to rise a notch."],["","Goman couldn't help but frown. He didn't know what the Predator with the strange eye mask saw, but he didn't like this mysterious way of speaking."],["Ada","...So, it wasn't just my imagination."],["Leopold","Ada? Did you notice something?"],["Ada","Although I didn't see any vibrant colors, I did feel a certain unusual attraction."],["","It seemed like a scent, a sound, and a shadow... Perhaps it was still far away, and she couldn't determine the source of this feeling."],["","Yet behind this strange sensation, she felt a trace of long-lost familiarity—a fleeting echo of what she experienced long ago, during the experiment conducted by the UNCS on her and her sister."],["","But this time, she has enough strength to protect everyone and uncover the truth."],["Ada","...Let's keep moving forward. Whatever it is, as long as it can save my sister, we must find it."]],"441605101":[["","Fifteen minutes later at the Vesper base."],["Lorenzo","9th Squad, respond quickly! 9th Squad!"],["Kaidan","Dana, Grant, let's take care of the autonomous weapons left by the enemy!"],["Kaidan","Epiphyllum and Camilla, go seize the control room and reopen the base gates!"],["Tiphys","Squad 08, search the base with me to find any possible survivors!"],["","Despite rushing back to the stronghold at top speed, by the time Kaidan and his group arrived, the perimeter was already under enemy control."],["","Fortunately, the enemy didn't have enough time to rebuild their defensive stronghold, and the line was easily breached."],["Vesper Captain","Cough... Lorenzo, I thought I wouldn't see you again..."],["","The captain of Squad 9 leaned against the wall, receiving medical treatment. Although she found it difficult to move, her injuries were miraculously not too severe."],["","Watching her defeated and injured team members being rescued from STs one by one, she suddenly let out a relieved yet miserable smile—the DLAF monster had clearly shown mercy."],["Lorenzo","…I'm glad you're okay."],["","Lorenzo also breathed a sigh of relief. However, at that moment, Squad 08, searching for other survivors, brought some bad news."],["Tiphys","What did you say? You can't find Elise!?"],["Squad 08 Member","We've searched the entire base and haven't seen her anywhere, and comms are down!"],["Vesper Warrior","Not only Dr. Elise, but Phoenix's life support pod and the ST Apophis have also disappeared!"],["Grant","No... could they have been taken by the enemy?"],["Dana","We need to catch up quickly!"],["Vesper Captain","The attackers seem to be targeting the deepest part of the base... Hurry, if we use the express cargo track, we should still catch up."],["","At that moment, a piercing alarm sounded in the base control room and in each ST—almost all operational reconnaissance radars issued an alert at the same time."],["Hong","What's going on!?"],["Sylvie","A large number of DLAF signals have appeared in the south—no, also in the east, west... they're everywhere!"],["Sylvie","The DLAF's full-scale attack has begun!"],["Lorenzo","Cassha, Arthur, can you hear me!? Abandon the fight immediately and retreat to the base... damn, long-distance communication is blocked!"],["","Lorenzo's tone revealed an unprecedented tension. He was well aware that with Vesper's current strength, they were at an extreme disadvantage against the DL's main forces."],["Tiphys","Lorenzo, take Squad 08 to support them!"],["Kaidan","Sylvie, Hong, you go help him too! Leave those guys who entered the stronghold to us!"],["","After settling the wounded and those unfortunate Sankara civilians caught in the battle, Squad 08 and Lorenzo completed their preparations at the fastest speed, piloting the battle-scarred STs to start afresh."],["","Meanwhile, the five members of GKD Parcel Service, Tiphys, and Camilla head towards the express cargo track to quickly reach the depths."],["Dana","Wait, where's Adele?"],["","Only then did everyone realize that Adele, who had been fighting alongside them, had disappeared without a trace, even Camilla hadn't noticed her departure."],["Grant","She must have fled upon hearing the news of the DL's full-scale attack! I knew those Harpy folks couldn't be trusted!"],["Grant","Forget it, whether she's here or not doesn't make a difference! Let's go!"],["","Kaidan attempted to connect to Adele's ST comms, but received no response. For now, he had to put that aside."],["","\".........\""],["","Just then, he suddenly heard a strange sound, like someone sobbing, like metallic friction, and like waves crashing against the rocks..."],["","But when he focused his attention to search for the source of the sound, all he could hear was a blaring alarm."],["Grant","Boss, Camilla, what are you two daydreaming about!?"],["Kaidan","...I got this!"],["","Kaidan glanced at Camilla, who was also a step behind, and could only temporarily suppress his doubts."]],"441605301":[["","While the battle on the ground is in full swing, the underground exploration is nearing its end."],["","With the detection device left by Goman and Libby's extraordinary perception abilities, they have completely locked onto the target…"],["","Although they encountered Vesper's autonomous defense system midway, it clearly couldn't delay them for even a second."],["Libby","We've arrived."],["","Libby stops in front of a massive security door."],["Libby","No doubt, the source of those vibrant colors is just ahead."],["Ada","I can feel it too, something is right behind the door..."],["","Ada attempts to access the control panel beside the door, only to find its system has completely shut down, unable to send any useful signals even if the code is altered."],["Libby","Please step back a bit, Captain Ada."],["","Libby's ST steps forward, the rail gun flips and extends from its back... then aims at the security door."],["","With a controlled shot, the rail gun precisely penetrates the locking mechanism at the upper center of the security door. The Predator guards then arrange circles of directional explosives centered around the opening."],["","Upon seeing this, Adam immediately retreats, using her ST to shield the Erinys."],["","*boom!* A brief and intense eruption sends debris scattering like raindrops, striking the STs with a crisp sound."],["","And the security door, whose structural stability was compromised, collapses with a loud crash."],["Libby","Ah... So that's it, this is the source of that color!"],["","\".........\""],["","The moment the security door fell, Ada clearly heard a certain sound."],["","Even sitting in the enclosed pilot cabin, she felt a breeze brush over her body, penetrating every cell."],["","Unlike Ada, Libby suddenly curled up in pain beside her."],["Libby","Ugh... Too bright... What is this..."],["Gideon","Disconnect from the visor, Libby, or your brain won't last long!"],["","The sudden communication not only prevented Libby from heading towards destruction but also pulled Ada back to reality from her daze."],["","Only then did she see the scene before her clearly."],["Ada","Is this... the ocean?"],["","Even though countless possibilities had been considered in her mind, the space behind the door still left Ada deeply surprised."],["Ada","No, no, that's not right. We're underground, still within the rock layers. This can't possibly be the real ocean."],["Ada","Wait, the metal detector is reacting. What is this...?"],["Gideon","Those are crystals of arashi material."],["Ada","...President Gideon?"],["Ada","I have seen raw arashi ore freshly mined a few times, and they never looked this peculiar."],["Gideon","The arashi ore you mentioned is merely an inorganic aggregate eroded by arashi material. What you see now is the original arashi material of this land."],["Gideon","They have maintained this form ever since they fell into the sea over a hundred years ago."],["Ada","Over a hundred years ago? Could it be... the asteroid \"Milkhama\"!?"],["","An asteroid fell into the sea, triggering a series of tectonic shifts that eventually gave rise to an island rich in unique minerals—the story of Milkhama Island's origin was something Ada had heard more than once."],["","But in her mind, it was merely a piece of folklore; it hadn't crossed her mind that, one day, she'd see the evidence for it with her own eyes."],["","She carefully observed the rocks and walls at the edge of this unusual space before her. After decades of erosion, they had turned into something Ada had seen before—raw arashi ore."],["Gideon","...The secret that her grandfather and Obelisk had been searching for decades was actually kept by the Milkhamans."],["Gideon","No wonder Vesper abandoned the guerrilla strategy and chose this place as their stronghold."],["","While the two were talking, Libby, who had turned off the visor function, finally recovered from the intense sensory impact."],["Libby","I'm sorry, President, please forgive my earlier indiscretion."],["Libby","Next, I will set up the particle device according to the planned schedule."],["","After obtaining Gideon's permission, Libby operated the ST and gave a slight bow to Ada. She then turned to the Predators, commanding them to set up a large number of particle devices."],["","Despite her activity, her sluggish movements revealed that she was still in some kind of pain."],["Gideon","Captain Ada, after Libby completes the setup, connect them to the Erinys along with the Legacy."],["Ada","...Before we start, I have to be clear on something—are these steps necessary to save my sister?"],["Gideon","Of course."],["","Faced with blunt doubts, Gideon showed no displeasure and simply responded affirmatively and calmly."],["Gideon","The \"Rebirth Serum\" injected by Rosa is essentially arashi matter in a highly-concentrated liquid form. It relies on the biological activity of the arashi matter itself to promote its fusion with human cells, giving the user the possibility of resonance."],["Gideon","Under normal circumstances, the arashi particles released from the serum should leave the body with normal metabolism... just like the members of the Reversion Squad who also used it."],["Ada","Then why is it that only my sister can't wake up?"],["Gideon","...As a Perfect Hyper-Aptamer, Rosa Díaz is extremely compatible with arashi material."],["Gideon","Those arashi particles not only failed to dissipate over time, but instead gathered within her body, endlessly stimulating nerve cells and interfering with the normal transmission of signals within the body..."],["Gideon","In a sense, she might now be more like a Nova-Frame in a state of continuous activation."],["","Ada couldn't help but clench her fists. This is roughly in line with Paloma's analysis, suggesting that Raphael Gideon wasn't lying, but it also means that Rosa is in a very dangerous state."],["Ada","What are you thinking?"],["Gideon","To restore her, the first thing to do is to break the false balance of arashi particles within her."],["Gideon","For this, there must be an external environment with an extremely high concentration of arashi particles, as well as a powerful algorithm device capable of precise adjustments to the balancing process."],["Ada","Is this why you chose this place, chose the Legacy..."],["","As a fellow Perfect Hyper-Aptamer who has been involved in various confidential studies within the DL, Ada, though not a scientist, can roughly understand the principles Dean explained."],["","However, this raises another question, and given her personality, she wouldn't choose to keep it to herself."],["Ada","Why would the Predators know about this method... This plan, these devices, don't seem like something that could be prepared on the fly."],["","For the first time, Gideon didn't immediately provide a calm and clear answer, but instead fell into a brief silence."],["Gideon","...You're not the only one who needs this technology, Captain Ada."],["","Ada blinked, detecting a fleeting sense of melancholy and hatred in Gideon's words. But she also knew Gideon wouldn't explain further, so she gave up on asking."],["Libby","President, the particle device has been set up, and you can start remote debugging."],["Gideon","...Alright, let's get started."],["","Central Mining Area, a hidden spot one kilometer from Vesper's base"],["DL Soldier","Captain, Officer Ma'at has arrived."],["","No response, until a series of footsteps approached, Victoria finally shifted her gaze from the monitor."],["Victoria","You've finally arrived, Ma'at. The Reversion Squad, Ovett Revolutionary Army, Obsidian, the Ashes... Vesper's stronghold has turned into a real powder keg..."],["Victoria","Now's our perfect chance to strike!"],["","However, Ma'at merely walked past her and reached out to turn off the monitor screen."],["Ma'at","It's not just the Vesper base that's plunged into chaos... Take a look at this."],["","As she spoke, Ma'at synced the latest data to Victoria—the intel of the entire Central Mining Area battlefield."],["","The blue dots representing the DLAF have completely surrounded the Central Mining Area and are steadily advancing towards the center; the red dots representing Vesper have been forced into a steady retreat—at least that's how it was five minutes ago."],["","However, now a large number of unmarked gray dots have appeared between the two, obstructing the contraction of the front line."],["Victoria","...And this is?"],["Ma'at","Shortly after the DLAF launched the attack, multiple unknown forces suddenly appeared in the Central Mining Area."],["Ma'at","Among them are Milkhamans who assist Vesper, underworld mercenaries who launch attacks on both sides, and even UNCS military police claiming to be in pursuit of the attackers who had struck the Convention Center..."],["Ma'at","According to the preliminary investigation by the Oversight Committee, the mastermind behind all this is a man calling himself \"Sand Whale\"—"],["Victoria","What, did you say Sand Whale!?"],["Ma'at","It is currently uncertain whether the Sand Whale you encountered before is the same individual. Therefore, the Oversight Committee needs your assistance."],["Victoria","...What about the Legacy?"],["Ma'at","The Security Maintenance Force and I will monitor it."],["","Victoria hesitated for a moment. She did want to catch Sand Whale herself, but she vaguely felt that things wouldn't be so simple."],["DL Captain","Requesting support! We've been ambushed by mercenary forces. Is there any nearby reinforcement available?"],["","The distress signal on the military channel finally forced her hand."],["Victoria","...Understood. If the Reversion Squad shows any unusual behavior, contact me immediately!"],["","No longer hesitating, Victoria accepted the order and led the team at full speed towards the allies."],["","Ma'at watches her disappear from view, then immediately orders her subordinates to thoroughly inspect the position, blocking all communication and monitoring devices."],["Ma'at","Enter the launch position and adjust the parameters as soon as possible."],["","With her command, the Security Maintenance Force's ST units unloaded several missile-like objects from several giant trucks and quickly deployed them onto the original launch platforms."],["Lukmund","Ready to roll?"],["Ma'at","Yes, sir. Victoria has been reassigned. The E weapon can be launched at any time... It's just..."],["Ma'at","Do we really need to do this?"],["","On a normal day, Ma'at Sharif would never voice such doubts to a superior, but now even she is having doubts."],["Lukmund","Ma'at Sharif, when a fire is about to get out of control, do you know how to extinguish it quickly?"],["Lukmund","You create an even bigger blast... When you exhaust the oxygen, you also exhaust the flame."],["","In a temporary depot not far from the stronghold, a red and black silhouette put down the binoculars."],["Adele","Hmm... Looks like things are getting interesting."],["","Through the cracks in the depot walls, she could clearly see the meeting and the departure of Ma'at and Victoria, as well as the setup work being carried out at the launch stronghold."],["","With a playful smile, she took out a special comms device and contacted that secret number."],["Adele","It's me, Adele."],["","Despite the DL's strict electromagnetic regulations in the Central Mining Area, the Harpy Guild, with influence spread across Milkhama Island, still finds ways to conduct unilateral encrypted communications."],["Adele","I have completed the task as you expected, and the necessary data has been sent."],["Adele","GKD Parcel Service is about to meet the Diaz sisters. What'll be their next step, I wonder...? In any case, the current situation proves your initial prediction was correct. Luckily, that's one bet I didn't make with you."],["Adele","I just wonder if the fate of Milkhama—and ours—can truly unfold the way you desire..."],["Adele","Oh, and forgive me for saying one more thing... Once the way one-way transmission ends, remember to wipe the Skynet node and destroy the device."],["Adele","Otherwise, a few mischievous kittens might try tracking us."],["","Mid-sentence Adele reaches for the pistol hidden under her coat. At the same moment, two agents close in on her from either side, moving in perfect unison."],["","Bang! Bang! The sound of continuous gunfire rings out. Adele ignores the attackers aiming at her head and heart, shooting straight at their comms devices instead."],["Adele","If you were smart, you would've shut me down first, Erisa Shinohara."],["","As Adele said, the two emerging from the shadows are none other than the long-lost Erisa squad, who have been operating covertly."],["Fia","Drop the gun, Adele Martin."],["Adele","Of course."],["","Unexpectedly, Adele offers no resistance and simply tosses her handgun aside."],["Erisa","I didn't think you'd just roll over like this."],["Adele","I'm not so arrogant to think I could slip away from two Hyper-Aptamers... and besides, even if I do nothing at all, you'll let me walk out of your own accord."],["Erisa","...Interesting, and why's that?"],["","Maintaining a smile, she signaled Fia with her eyes to take out something from her pocket—a little pink teddy bear doll."],["Fia","Isn't that the doll Alyson carries with her? What did you do to her!?"],["Adele","We Harpy would never harm the Doll family's daughter. This is merely a... symbol of cooperation."],["Fia","Cooperation? Cooperation with who?!"],["Erisa","...Ah, this is really troublesome. Who would have thought those stubborn old Dolls would go as far as using Alyson as a bargaining chip."],["","Though Erisa's tone is relaxed, her gaze is icy cold. Even so, she still puts away the gun in her hand."],["Erisa","Put down your gun, Fia."],["Fia","...Alright."],["","Fia hesitated for a moment but eventually put down her weapon. Unlike those big shots hiding in the shadows, they wouldn't gamble with Alyson's safety."],["","Free from their hold, Adele leisurely tidied up her attire and turned to look at the two with a playful look in her eyes."],["Adele","Hmm... I'm heading back to the Harpy headquarters next. What are your plans?"],["Adele","Just a reminder, even if you rush over now, you won't be able to stop those missiles from launching."],["Erisa","...Fia, try to contact Alyson, and if you can't reach her, make sure you keep an eye on this one!"],["Fia","What about you?"],["Erisa","I'll go hold off Ma'at's forces. Even if it's too late, it's better than doing nothing!"]],"441606101":[["","Whoosh—"],["","Kaidan stared in astonishment at the scene before him."],["Kaidan","...Where am I?"],["","At some point, he had left the cockpit and was standing on a strange shore shimmering with starlight."],["","Vesper's outpost, marching STs, partners moving together... It was as if reality had been replaced in an instant—everything he perceived was now different."],["Kaidan","A sea of arashi particles... Why?"],["","It's not the first time he's seen this kind of scene, but Kaidan had just been heading to Vesper's outpost—he hasn't a clue how he suddenly ended up here."],["Kaidan","Dana, Grant, are you there!? Rear Admiral Tiphys—"],["","His call stirred up ripples of particles in the sea and air, spreading outward."],["","\".........\""],["","Suddenly, he caught a response. It wasn't a sound echoing from afar; it was more like something fely directly in his mind, bypassing all processes."],["Kaidan","From behind...?"],["","Following this sudden clear thought, he stopped moving forward and turned to look back."],["","......"],["","..."],["","Two figures stood a short distance away, gesturing as if in conversation."],["Kaidan","Hey, you over there, can you hear me?"],["","Perhaps Kaidan's call reached their ears, as they suddenly turned around. At the same time, the surrounding stars scattered through the air like startled fireflies."],["","The once deep blue space is suddenly filled with colorful bubbles, like fragments of a shattered kaleidoscope, covering the sky and sea."],["Kaidan","Damn it, what's going on with these things!"],["","He carefully avoids the strange and eerie bubbles while trying to approach the figures beyond."],["","Although the distance isn't far, every time he tries to make out the faces of the two people, a new bubble blocks his line of sight."],["","\"Ugh, come on...\" Unable to get close to the target and disoriented by the bizarre scene surrounding him, Kaidan's nerves began to fray. He quickened his pace, but the bubbles only increased."],["Kaidan","No..."],["","The bubbles multiply around Kaidan, obscuring his view entirely, surrounding him. Unable to make out even his next step, he edges forward into the colorful bubbles. Losing his footing, his body swings forward and plunges down into the churning sea of particles below."],["","As he falls, he suddenly catches sight of something behind the two figures, a third presence, hidden behind."],["Rosa?","................"],["Kaidan","...Rosa!?"],["","In the next moment, all his senses are stripped away, plunging him into endless darkness..."],["Kaidan","...!"],["","*beep-beep-beep*"],["","The incessant ringing of an alarm irritates his ears. In front of him, the monitor only shows a plain steel wall."],["","Kaidan surveys the familiar cockpit around him, feeling the control stick in his hand once more."],["Grant","What are you doing, boss!? Suddenly driving the mech into the wall, I thought you found a hidden door!"],["Kaidan","Grant... I guess that means I'm back."],["Dana","Back? What do you mean, Kaidan?"],["","Kaidan didn't answer immediately. Instead, he took a few deep breaths, confirmed his body was fine, and then maneuvered the ST back into formation."],["Kaidan","It's nothing, It's just... I guess I was hallucinating or something."],["Grant","...That's kinda messed up. You okay, boss?"],["Dana","The life support system of the unit hasn't detected any abnormalities. Could it just be fatigue?"],["Kaidan","I don't know..."],["","At that moment, a flash of blue light from the safety lamp in the corner of his vision suddenly helped him grasp the key."],["Kaidan","Dana, activate the particle monitor—scan for arashi particles!"],["","Not quite connecting the dots, Dana still activated the particle monitor as he said. Just as the system completed initialization and entered active measurement mode, all the monitors issued a high-energy early warning."],["Dana","This... A large amount of arashi particles are being detected spreading outward from the base, and the particle density around us has already increased by more than ten times!"],["Dana","The source of the particle diffusion... No, it's beyond the precise identification range of the detector."],["Grant","Where did all these arashi particles come from? Last time we were here, we didn't encounter anything like this, did we?"],["Tiphys","It might be something to do with that crashing sound we detected earlier."],["","Tiphys also confirmed a similar reaction on his ST detector, but unfortunately, Elise is currently missing, and no one present has the ability to continue the analysis."],["","If that's not just an illusion, but like last time, a space formed by the resonance of arashi particles and the Nova-Frame..."],["","Kaidan suddenly thought of the three figures he saw there. If one of them was truly Rosa—"],["Kaidan","We'd better hurry up. Their experiment might have already started!"]],"441606301":[["","*beep-beep-beep*"],["","The alarm inside the ST continues to sound, but the anticipated detonation has yet to occur."],["Elise","The particle device generated a reverse constraint electric field, suppressing the activity of the arashi particles."],["Elise","But this is only temporary; before the device overloads and breaks down, we need to leave the base as quickly and as far as possible."],["Rosemary","Without support from the Legacy, how did that ST manage... No, there must be something lending it extraordinary processing power..."],["","Elise did not answer. She lowered her head, making it impossible to see her expression through the communication window."],["Kaidan","...Phoenix, is that you?"],["???","................"],["Grant","What, isn't Phoenix already...?"],["Tiphys","...A Bionic Intelligence Frame."],["Tiphys","Elise, you put Phoenix's brain—"],["Phoenix","Don't blame her, Father."],["Phoenix","This is what \"I\" hope for too."],["","Suddenly, the ground beneath begins to shake, and the rock layer above, pierced by bunker-buster rounds, continues to collapse."],["Dana","A device has burned out due to being overloaded. The arashi particles are reactivating!"],["Phoenix","You should leave now while there's still time to get back to the surface."],["","Everyone's ST systems received a new route guidance from Apophis, allowing them to leave the base as quickly as possible via the nearby emergency lift."],["Kaidan","Wait, Phoenix, what about you?"],["Phoenix","I'll stay here to maintain the device until the very last moment."],["Kaidan","But—"],["Phoenix","A long rest, deep underground—that's where the dead belong, Kaidan."],["Kaidan","...!"],["Dana","Is this really okay, Elise!?"],["Elise","...The elevator is operational again, follow me."],["","As if trying to escape her own hesitation, Elise's ST bolted around and drove away, without even glancing at Apophis."],["","With a heavy crash, a huge boulder above crushed a Predator unit that failed to retreat in time. Its torso twisted violently under the pressure, spilling a dark fluid, perhaps oil—perhaps not."],["","On the other side, the Erinys and Legacy had already exited the area under the escort of Libby and Ada. There was no point in staying any longer."],["Tiphys","...Let's go."],["Rosemary","Rear Admiral Tiphys..."],["","At this point, Kaidan could only grit his teeth and make a decision."],["Kaidan","...Follow Elise, we must return alive!"],["","Another series of rock collapses cut off the last passage between Apophis and Kaidan and the others, completely blocking the view."],["Phoenix?","Elise and Vesper are entrusted to you, Father."],["Tiphys","...Farewell, my child."],["","On the shattered radar screen of Apophis, the blue dots marking friendly units began to pull away at high speed."],["","Under the interference of particles, they quickly disappeared, unable to be captured again."],["","Central Mining Area main battlefield, Vesper Front — ten minutes before the Great Explosion"],["Vesper Soldier","Look, the mine entrance is glowing! Did the DLAF do something?"],["Vesper Captain","No, there's something coming from our base's direction too!"],["Arthur","Cassha, could this be...!?"],["Cassha","This is bad, everyone withdraw from combat! Stay away from all ground openings and mine facilities!"],["","Central Mining Area southern battlefield, DLAF front — six minutes before the Great Explosion"],["DL Soldier","Hmm, the ground suddenly started shaking... Could it be an earthquake!?"],["DL Captain","Calm down, Milkhama doesn't experience earthquakes that easily. Send the reconnaissance team to check if Vesper is preparing another new weapon."],["Victoria","Wait, an emergency notice from Headquarters has arrived—what? High-energy particles... a large-scale explosion?"],["Victoria","All units, abandon the mission and retreat immediately!"],["","Central Mining Area northern battlefield, Ovett Revolutionary Army front — five minutes before the Great Explosion"],["Ovett Revolutionary Army","Major, what should we do next?"],["Yevgeny","Lukmund, that madman—he has no idea what kind of disaster his attack will cause!"],["Yevgeny","Have Alpha Squad withdraw, the arashi matter can wait."],["Yevgeny","...Also, notify \"Avalanche\" to prepare for Ovett's Royal Guard."],["","Central Mining Area battlefield outskirts, front of the Milkhaman United Front — three minutes before the Great Explosion"],["Milkhama Rebel","What... what's going on? Are those DLAF troops suddenly retreating?"],["Milkhama Rebel","Vesper personnel are also preparing to withdraw. What exactly is happening??"],["UNCS Elite Agent","Attention all squads, evacuate the Milkhamans from the Central Mining Area immediately, the sooner the better!"],["UNCS Operative","What? But the director hasn't—"],["UNCS Elite Agent","This is an urgent order from Anderson. He will stay behind to assist the director and then meet us at Safehouse 66."],["UNCS Elite Agent","Countless lives are at stake—act immediately!"],["","XC 119, March 8, 18:47 — 10 minutes after the explosion."],["","UNCS Sunset Valley Military Prison, third level, deepest part of the solitary surveillance area."],["Raven","...Was that an earthquake just now?"],["","The tremor wasn't intense, yet the persistent, unnatural quivering of objects on the desk put Raven on edge."],["","He'd been here almost four months since his trial for obstructing a public investigation, yet never before had he felt the place shake for this long."],["","An explosion...? Is someone attacking this military prison?"],["","No way. The alarms were silent, and with the Sunset Valley encampment so close—home to the bulk of the mobile troops—only a fool would try striking here."],["Raven","Orr, are you there?"],["","Raven tries to call out to the prison guard he has become familiar with."],["","If you're looking for the prison guard, I'm sorry, he's taking a nap."],["","Click—the lock on the cell's metal security door was suddenly released, and a person began to enter."],["","Raven instinctively reached for his waist, then remembered that his usual handgun wasn't there."],["Wyatt","Don't worry—it's me."],["Raven","Uncle Wyatt?"],["","Unexpectedly, the person in front of him, Raven, was not a stranger at all."],["","Wyatt Morgan, Lieutenant Colonel of the UNCS—former ace of the UNCS Mobile Battalion, a comrade of his father, and Raven's instructor in his youth."],["","If it weren't for the falling out due to differing beliefs years ago, he might still be fighting under Blair's command."],["Wyatt","Long time no see, Raven. I'm here to take you away."],["Raven","...Sorry, Uncle, I won't leave here until my sentence is complete."],["Wyatt","Of course, I know you've reached an agreement with the GSA, and it's normal for you not to want to leave here."],["Wyatt","But unfortunately, even if you stay here obediently for half a year, what awaits you will not be a peaceful future."],["","Wyatt took out a data terminal. He tapped away, seeming to pull up a video, and then tossed it to Raven."],["","A live news report from the Central Mining Area was playing."],["","The eruption in the Central Mining Area continues! As we can see, STs, armored vehicles, tanks... debris is everywhere—it's impossible to tell who's who!"],["","Meanwhile, all the mining facilities and surface openings are continuously spewing blue flames! Could this be related to the current devastation?"],["","What exactly is beneath the Central Mining Area... Wait, why are they stopping us from filming? Excuse me, we have a right to be here! Excuse me—"],["","*bang* After a gunshot, the news footage suddenly turned into a screen full of static."],["Raven","An explosion the Central Mining Area? Could the recent tremors also be..."],["Wyatt","Who knows which bastard did this, but the Central Mining Area's a complete mess."],["Wyatt","Vesper, Ovett, DL, GSA, GKD... no one knows how many will survive in the end."],["Wyatt","...just like Milthus 20 years ago."],["Raven","What, GKD Parcel Service? Are Kaidan and the others in the Central Mining Area too!?"],["","Raven's eyes widened involuntarily. He hurriedly manipulated the terminal, trying to obtain more useful information."],["","However, most public channels were silent at this moment, and even on Skynet, more and more nodes were being restricted."],["Wyatt","Comprehensive information control has already begun, and this time it's not just West Milkhama, but the entire island... perhaps it's already too late."],["Wyatt","There is something underground in the Central Mining Area that is enough to trigger a high concentration of arashi particle eruption—this fact is enough to attract the attention of those who are interested."],["Raven","...So that's why you appeared in Milkhama."],["Raven","Did the military send you? What are they planning now!?"],["Wyatt","I don't mind sharing military intelligence with my comrades, but I won't do the same for a prisoner."],["Raven","I..."],["","Raven took a step forward, then hesitated... His uncertainty and confusion was palpable."],["","Wyatt didn't rush him, just turned and walked out of the cell."],["Wyatt","Ten minutes—this is the maximum time I can give you to think, and it's the safe time to ensure that the prison guard named Orr doesn't wake up."],["Wyatt","Prepare your answer well, Raven. What we're about to face is no joke."]],"441651101":[["","XC 119, March 8, 18:36 — one minute before the Great Explosion"],["Kaidan","Hold on, I see the elevator!"],["","The red lights warning of danger illuminated every corner of the base, the damaged speakers intermittently emitted distorted alarm sounds. Even the floors and walls showed terrifying deformations amidst the gradually intensifying tremors."],["","The ST maintains high-speed movement while avoiding various obstacles, finally stepping onto the elevator."],["","But as if mocking their efforts, the elevator started but could only ascend slowly, the control panel constantly flashing a red warning light."],["Grant","Damn, our STs are too heavy—there's not enough power!"],["","Even the large lift platform used for transporting minerals and engineering STs is not suitable for quickly transporting a total of six combat STs."],["Dana","We're gonna have to leave a few STs behind!"],["Elise","Wait, the base is now filled with a large amount of harmful gas—don't be so quick to open that cabin!"],["Grant","Th-Then what should we do!?"],["","At that moment, a sudden muffled sound echoed, like a giant stone falling into the deep sea. Immediately after, there was a rapidly diffusing ripple—a deadly shockwave."],["","Looking back, the visible blue flames and the monstrous roar of explosions were rapidly coming down the passage towards everyone."],["Tiphys","Here comes the big one!"],["","XC 119, March 8, 18:37:44 — A runaway arashi matter explosion tore through the depths of the Vesper base."],["","And right now, the sole means of escape had risen no more than five meters."],["Kaidan","...Dana, aim at that brake valve!"],["Dana","What?"],["Kaidan","I'll explain later—quickly open fire!"],["","Though puzzled, Dana swiftly executed Kaidan's order. She aimed and fired, precisely destroying the safety brake valve beside the lift platform."],["Kaidan","Secure your feet to the platform, hold onto the person next to you, and prepare for G-force resistance!"],["Rosemary","...So that's the plan."],["Tiphys","Elise, activate your control seat's protection mode—curl up and protect your head!"],["","The shockwave from the explosion below hit the bottom of the lift platform solidly, causing it to rise several meters almost instantly."],["","2m/s... 8m/s... 17m/s... Without the safety valve, gravity and friction are no longer enough to limit acceleration. The surging conflagration becomes new thrust, lifting the platform faster and faster."],["Grant","Aaaaaaaghhh!!!"],["Kaidan","Hang tight, don't let your ST lose balance!"],["","Even with prior preparation, the rapid acceleration over a short period still placed a certain burden on the body and caused some structural destruction even to battle-hardened STs like theirs."],["","As they rapidly ascended, the distance to the ground rapidly shortened—at the same time, this also meant that the space available for them to slow down was decreasing."],["Dana","Oh no, the protective gate at the end of the passage hasn't opened properly— brace yourselves, we're gonna crash!"],["Tiphys","That level of armor should be penetrable with a high-power weapon!"],["","For a moment, all STs raised their weapons, aiming at the increasingly close top protective door."],["Kaidan","Open Fire!"],["","Shotguns, machine guns, heavy sniper rifles, rockets... Everyone unleashes all available firepower in a desperate attempt to create an opening."],["","A mere protective door meant to block entry and exit couldn't withstand such firepower. Almost instantly, it was torn open along with the ceiling above, revealing the dust-laden sky of the mining area."],["Kaidan","Release the foot anchors—prepare for impact!"],["","Accompanied by a loud crash, the lift platform finally reached the end of its rail, its huge momentum slamming to a crashing halt."],["","The STs on the platform maintained their original high speed, shooting out of the opening and flying twenty meters above the ground."],["","The role of the gravity now inverted. No longer their life-saving brake, it catapulted them downward, straight toward the jagged, rocky ground."],["Rosemary","Open the emergency parachute! Brake as soon as you touchdown, ride the nearest incline to cut the force!"],["Tiphys","STs without reverse thrusters are approaching me."],["","Tiphys cut the parachute when approaching the slope, heavily slamming his large shield and foot anchors into the ground, coordinating with the ST's posture control to bleed off as much speed as possible."],["","The subsequent falling STs were immediately met by him, followed by several STs jointly slowing down to catch the remaining units. They steadily decelerated, eventually returning to normal operational limits."],["Grant","We... survived!!!"],["","Bang—another huge sound blasts from the shaft. Turning back, they see the lift platform, now a gaping void lined with twisted steel, blue flames gushing forth like a hellish fountain."],["Dana","The blast below isn't over yet...!"],["Kaidan","Cut the parachute and get out of here first!"]],"441651301":[["","Ten minutes after leaving the central battlefield."],["William","Area secure, clear to proceed."],["","After destroying the last Ovett Recon puppet, the GKD Parcel Service accelerated through the open area in the western part of the mining zone."],["","They are now not far from the transport aircraft."],["Kaidan","Still can't reach Matilda and Hardaway?"],["Dana","No, the explosion of arashi matter has disrupted the electromagnetic environment of the entire mining area, making it difficult to maintain even short-distance communication."],["Grant","The good news is that the enemy's radar will also fail, whether it's the DL main force or the Ovett Revolutionary Army, they won't be able to find us even if they try."],["Dana","Huh... ST are approaching from up ahead!"],["Dana","Unable to identify specific numbers and features... the other side seems to be causing interference...!"],["Grant","Huh? Speak of the devil... could it be the enemy!?"],["William","At least it won't be the Blackout Squad."],["","Also detecting an abnormal signal, William almost instantly locked onto the target and raised his heavy machine gun."],["William","Suppressive fire, now!"],["Kaidan","Wait, William!"],["","Just as the machine gun was about to unleash its fire, Möbius suddenly reached out and forcibly lowered the muzzle, sending a burst of bullets into the ground, kicking up clouds of dust."],["William","What's the meaning of this, Kaidan Newman?"],["Kaidan","The sync ratio of the testee unit is increasing... If I'm not mistaken—"],["Ada","Who would have thought the Nova-Frame could also replace the radar?"],["","The ST emerging through the smoke is no stranger to GKD Parcel Service—just minutes ago, she stood on the opposite side, dominating the battlefield with overwhelming power."],["","Her ST was covered in cracks and bullet marks, indicating that the successive battles and eruptions had also caused her significant damage."],["Kaidan","...Ada!"],["Grant","What!?"],["","Except for Kaidan, everyone else instinctively raised their weapon at Ada. Even so, she showed no reaction; instead, she seemed more concerned about something behind her."],["","The dust finally completely dissipated at this moment, and everyone noticed another pitch-black ST standing not far behind Ada."],["Ada","Finally brought my sister here safely."],["","Hmm..."],["","A faint murmur came from the ST comms, seemingly some kind of dream talk."],["Dana","Did Rosa respond?"],["Ada","The Predator experiment was effective. After resonating with Kaidan, the excess arashi particles in sister's body indeed transferred outward."],["Ada","Next, she just needs to rest for a while, and sister will return to normal... and become that \"Valkyrie\" again."],["Grant","Turn back into \"Valkyrie\"?"],["Kaidan","You said you wanted Rosa to become an ordinary person without special abilities, away from all conflicts. Could it be..."],["Ada","The blast of arashi material further enhanced my sister's affinity for it, something none of us expected, and it completely derailed our plans."],["Ada","The best outcome now is to wait for my sister to wake up naturally... but this requires a safe environment and enough time."],["","Ada turns around, remaining silent for a long time. Though the cold metal face of the ST shows no expression, Kaidan can still sense a hint of reluctance and conflict."],["Ada","...Please take my sister away."],["Kaidan","...What?"],["","For a moment, Kaidan thought he misheard, and Dana and Grant reacted with the same astonishment."],["Ada","For the time being, I won't be able to stay with my sister. Since that's the case, I must entrust her to someone trustworthy who won't harm her."],["Ada","Someone who doesn't belong to any faction, won't exploit her for gain, and won't abandon her in danger..."],["Kaidan","......"],["Ada","Saying these things right after a fight, it's emotional blackmail, I know. It's shameless—"],["Ada","But I still want to ask you to take my sister away and protect her."],["Dana","Well... of course we want to protect Rosa, but what about you?"],["Kaidan","You can come with us, Ada."],["Ada","...I like your suggestion, Kaidan. But I can't."],["Ada","I have issues that must be dealt with. Besides, the entire Reversion Squad was dragged down because of my recklessness and became a target of the Oceanic Conclave... I must take responsibility for this."],["","Warning, abnormal heat source signal detected 30 meters underground, approaching the area where this unit is located."],["","Another tremor shakes the ground, accompanied by the sound of alarms."],["Grant","Damn, we're almost in the Parill Desert—yet we're still not out of the blast zone!"],["Ada","The detonation of the arashi matter shoots outward like a fire chasing a fuse line, branching through the main lode and setting each deposit ablaze... the explosions are bound to continue for quite a while."],["","As she spoke, Ada's ST turned around, moving in the direction the GKD Squad came from."],["Kaidan","You're planning to return to the mining area!?"],["Ada","Only in this way will \"those guys\" not immediately notice that my sister and I have separated."],["Ada","Don't worry, a few small explosions and enemies can't do anything to me—I'm a super pilot."],["","In the comms window, Ada smiled... but only briefly. As her ST moved farther away, interference overook the feed, leaving the image barely recognizable."],["Ada","Sister—*bzzt*—I'll leave her to you."],["Kaidan","...I promise Rosa will be safe and sound."],["Ada","*bzzt*—*bzzt*————"],["","Communication can no longer be maintained; the ST has completely vanished from the optical sensor's detection range."],["Kaidan","Let's go to Milthus."],["","Meanwhile, Northern Central Mining Area, Predator Temporary Camp"],["Masked Voice","Never thought you would let the Valkyrie fall into the hands of GKD Parcel Service."],["Masked Voice","Hope you haven't forgotten, the ones picking them up are the Blackout Squad... This means handing the initiative over to Obelisk."],["Gideon","Having such concerns proves you don't understand Obsidian well enough, Nehru."],["Gideon","Valkyrie's arrival at Milthus will undoubtedly alarm the board, and those coveting the chairman's position will certainly seize the opportunity to intervene, creating a check on Obelisk."],["Gideon","If he uses Valkyrie as a bargaining chip, it means opposing GKD Parcel Service and the Epiphyllum girls—whatever choice he makes, he must pay a certain cost."],["","However, in response to Raphael Gideon's explanation, Professor Nehru on the other end of the communication merely snorted, not buying it."],["Masked Voice","Hmph, I don't believe you would make such a risky decision just for some vague political maneuvering."],["Masked Voice","What you truly value is the technology left by Francis, isn't it?"],["","Francis Gideon, a research expert who co-founded Obsidian with Obelisk, is also Raphael's grandfather."],["","It was his mysterious death that ignited the fuse of the Milkhama War, and also etched an irreparable rift between Raphael and Obelisk."],["Gideon","...In order to realize the plan within a limited time, grandfather's technology is necessary."],["Masked Voice","Of course, when it comes to the field of arashi matter, I always trust Francis Gideon to get reliable results. If I could obtain them, my research progress would accelerate significantly—"],["Masked Voice","The question is, how can you ensure that Obelisk will definitely bring out that technology? For over twenty years, that old fox hasn't shown a single flaw."],["Gideon","He will."],["","Raphael simply gave a calm and affirmative response."],["Gideon","The situation has already changed. The explosion in the Central Mining Area has exposed the existence of arashi matter to the world, and it won't be long before Milkhama Island becomes a battlefield once again."],["Gideon","The Principality of Ovett will not remain indifferent either... To counter their Royal Guard, Obelisk will certainly not overlook the potential of Valkyrie and Kaidan Newman."],["Gideon","And at that time, the Predators will begin its true actions."]]};
